{"key":70783,"since":70783,"day":"2026-11-15","src":["game"],"patch":"12.1.5","from":70688,"official":["https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24307310/hotfixes-november-6-2026"],"sane":["Checked: Nameplates' combat text writes a hidden amount as it is; Social's friend list hands the sub icon to the game's title icon"],"points":[{"section":"General","kind":"point","text":"A small build: the numbers of The Venomous Abyss's bosses and two renamed Tortollans, with two changes to what addons are told","origin":"client"},{"section":"General","kind":"note","text":"Compared with Blizzard's hotfixes of November 5 and 6, the days since build 70688 first appeared; Blizzard has published no patch notes for this build. Nothing of Retail's data goes into the database yet but these notes.","origin":"client"},{"section":"Dungeons and Raids","kind":"point","text":"Malignance deals 37% less damage on Mythic, and its damage over time lasts 16 seconds there","origin":"both","group":"The Venomous Abyss","sub":"Vashnik, the Malignant","link":"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24307310/hotfixes-november-6-2026"},{"section":"Dungeons and Raids","kind":"point","text":"Health on Raid Finder, Normal and Heroic scales differently, and the base health of Ula'tek, Blightscale Rawling, Blightscale Viper, Blightscale Shrieker and Weakened Doomscale is lower there","origin":"blizzard","group":"The Venomous Abyss","sub":"Ula'tek","link":"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24307310/hotfixes-november-6-2026"},{"section":"Dungeons and Raids","kind":"point","text":"Ula'tek has 15% less health on Heroic","origin":"blizzard","group":"The Venomous Abyss","sub":"Ula'tek","link":"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzard.com/en-us/news/24307310/hotfixes-november-6-2026"},{"section":"Dungeons and Raids","kind":"point","text":"Unchecked Rage deals 61% less damage on every difficulty","origin":"both","group":"The Venomous Abyss","sub":"Ula'tek","link":"https://worldofwarcraft.blizzar